      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This problem was partially solved with the particle system limiter we implemented a few years back. However, the community (in particular, those who created complex avatar animations) disagreed with the change and asked us to make it optional and off by default-- so we did that.\nIf you want to enable the avatar particle system limits, please [see our documentation](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/avatar-particle-system-limits) for instructions on how to enable it and configure it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
